# Mechatron Prime build targets for pmarreck/llm_skills.
#
# This repository is Bash tooling plus its skills, not documentation: the
# check runs the full ./test suite inside a pure Nix sandbox, so a dependency
# satisfied only by a globally installed tool fails here instead of surviving
# as a false green.
checks.x86_64-linux.test

# The writing-elm example: its offline production build, and its formatter,
# tests and elm-review run offline in the sandbox, so a nixpkgs update that
# breaks the skill's recipe fails CI.
checks.x86_64-linux.writing-elm-example
checks.x86_64-linux.writing-elm-example-checks

# The writing-lean examples: each compiles with nixpkgs' Lean without
# warnings and uses only Lean's standard axioms.
checks.x86_64-linux.writing-lean-examples
